  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 2ndInvestigationReport
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'Alors, du nouveau ? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2fbf2b38a1c8acc40bdb6922f04023e3, type: 2}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 1
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Une servante m\u2019a pr\xE9venu qu'un journaliste aurait \xE9t\xE9 vu
      pr\xE8s de la porte du bureau. Le probl\xE8me est que je n\u2019ai pas d\u2019informations
      suppl\xE9mentaires dessus. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e8b0952fd02ce843a8b6d84d4206073, type: 2}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Hmmm. Je pense savoir qui elle a aper\xE7u, on a un suspect correspondant
      \xE0 ce profil. Je te donnerai son num\xE9ro. Elle t\u2019a dit autre chose
      ?  "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d2cf0fef1fc381b43b34bd74e787eab9, type: 2}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Apparemment, la s\xE9curit\xE9 voulait me parler et je les ai donc contact\xE9s.
      \xC0 part le fait qu'ils m\u2019accusent du meurtre, je n\u2019ai rien obtenu
      d\u2019important ! "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0cdd40c01e9395f4c80e32515a18a06d, type: 2}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Si \xE7a se trouve... "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ad1b66d53da48e41a2aacd435a202d7, type: 2}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Non je plaisante, je sais bien que tu ne ferais pas \xE7a. Tu as pu contacter
      la fameuse Holly Marie ?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Oui, elle semble avoir pass\xE9 la soir\xE9e dans le salon. Cependant,
      elle m\u2019a aussi avou\xE9 avoir eu une relation pass\xE9e avec Monsieur
      Warner."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Tr\xE8s int\xE9ressant... Tu as pu confirmer son alibi ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "\xC0 vrai dire, elle m\u2019a avou\xE9 qu\u2019elle n\u2019\xE9tait pas
      toute la soir\xE9e dans le salon. Et une autre personne me l\u2019a confirm\xE9.
      Il s\u2019agissait de... "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9eed29ce5d901749a981f5822ca5f1b, type: 2}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d126d54a7a42cb741be5fcbb08a76353, type: 2}
  conditionScene: {fileID: 0}
  conditionToUnlock: []
